                                                "sense_id": "0aa21566-3846-3f11-b426-371140143d8e",
                                                "text": "Of the total labour force now threatened with redundancy, of course, a proportion will be covered by natural wastage, so that the number eventually thrown out of railway work will be well below 19,000."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
