                                                "sense_id": "7798aa12-8c26-3d76-a90b-be9110334bd2",
                                                "text": "“There is no question the US economy will get smaller as you deport a lot of the workforce,” Kent Smetters, professor of business economics and public policy at the University of Pennsylvania’s Wharton School, said in an interview."
